@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
title Create Civic Report Sequence Diagram

actor Citizen
participant "Mobile UI" as App
participant AuthContext
participant "Report Controller" as API
participant "Cloudinary API" as CDN
database MongoDB

Citizen -> App : Enter details & snap photo
App -> AuthContext : Retrieve JWT
App -> API : POST /api/reports (FormData + JWT)
API -> API : Verify JWT Middleware
API -> CDN : Stream Image Buffer
CDN --> API : Secure Image URL
API -> MongoDB : Report.create({data, location, imageURL})
MongoDB --> API : Saved Document
API -> MongoDB : User.update(trustScore++)
API --> App : 201 Created
App --> Citizen : Show Success & Navigate
@enduml
